I got my backpack and boots and all that stuff.

159
00:11:49,660 --> 00:11:57,640
Although the trail is steep and narrow, we shall rise to the summit and gloriously declare our victory.

160
00:11:57,640 --> 00:12:00,600
Well, we all got our backpacks and our boots and everything.

161
